--TEST--
a key in an attribute's payload highlights each key that names the same declared field in the document, and not the declaration, like a member's use, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`
--FILE--
<?nvs
attribute Index on class { columns: string }
attribute Unique on class { columns: string }

#[Index(col<|>umns: "email")]
#[Unique(columns: "email")]
class Order {}

#[Index(columns: "name")]
class Customer {}
--REQUEST--
documentHighlight
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:5:9
case.nvs:9:9
